	(text "U201 SN74LVC8T245: DIR = +3V3 (A -> B). ACT_OE_N high (R501 on Controller) or VCCA/VCCB < 100 mV -> all outputs Hi-Z; gate pull-ups -> Q20x on -> ESC and servo lines LOW (no pulse)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9708e531-5b61-5b91-afda-d1934960350d")
	)
	(text "Connector outputs: B -> Q20x open drain (pull-up via BAT54 + 2.2k) -> 470 Ohm -> pin 1; inverted (firmware). J102/J103 Micro-Fit, J104/J105 2.54 mm headers (0.5 A budget), J106 ESC with pin 2 (BEC +) not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "356d2ad3-63de-5908-9d37-b04c0a0527d8")
	)
	(text "ESD: a TVS at each connector pin must tolerate 7.81 V continuously (servo-rail fault, ESC BEC) – selection open (O-30). LED_1..3_5V go to Lighting_IO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c9108198-5a8a-5512-811f-3e284bc85417")
	)
